{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "03237",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.54,
      "end_seconds": 3.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "Sorry I'm a little late, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 4.12,
      "end_seconds": 8.44,
      "duration_seconds": 4.32,
      "text": "That's fine, sit down. Tell me why you came."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.78,
      "end_seconds": 16.53,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "I'm here because of flakes on my shoulders."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 16.86,
      "end_seconds": 17.84,
      "duration_seconds": 0.98,
      "text": "I follow."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 18.4,
      "end_seconds": 21.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "Oh, and an itchy scalp."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 23.15,
      "end_seconds": 26.71,
      "duration_seconds": 3.56,
      "text": "Would you say mild, moderate or severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 27.4,
      "end_seconds": 40.99,
      "duration_seconds": 13.59,
      "text": "Hmm, maybe a eight out of ten on a bad day. I, I had a little redness before. That's settled now, um, though."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 43.07,
      "end_seconds": 47.84,
      "duration_seconds": 4.77,
      "text": "Did you get pain, pus, rash elsewhere or hair loss?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 49.84,
      "end_seconds": 52.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "No, nothing to report there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 53.39,
      "end_seconds": 55.34,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "Is your digestion otherwise okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 56.49,
      "end_seconds": 58.22,
      "duration_seconds": 1.73,
      "text": "Nothing unusual, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 59.52,
      "end_seconds": 62.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "Any muscle or joint problems besides this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 64.11,
      "end_seconds": 65.55,
      "duration_seconds": 1.44,
      "text": "Nothing else aches."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 66.35,
      "end_seconds": 71.99,
      "duration_seconds": 5.64,
      "text": "Tell me about your routine, work, habits, that sort of thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 74.01,
      "end_seconds": 84.02,
      "duration_seconds": 10.01,
      "text": "Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts. I'm vegetarian and have been for years. My partner and our baby."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 98.94,
      "end_seconds": 103.39,
      "duration_seconds": 4.45,
      "text": "Alright, are you taking anything regularly, including from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 104.7,
      "end_seconds": 120.05,
      "duration_seconds": 15.35,
      "text": "Omeprazole. I take it 20 milligrams, once a day for the reflux. My family kept telling me to get it checked. It's the not knowing that gets to me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 120.26,
      "end_seconds": 124.51,
      "duration_seconds": 4.25,
      "text": "I follow. Did you ever have any procedures done?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 125.07,
      "end_seconds": 132.16,
      "duration_seconds": 7.09,
      "text": "Sorry, what was I saying, yes, I had a bunion operation, six years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 133.55,
      "end_seconds": 138.23,
      "duration_seconds": 4.68,
      "text": "Do you react to any medicines or foods? Any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 139.98,
      "end_seconds": 148.33,
      "duration_seconds": 8.35,
      "text": "Years back I got bad stomach cramps from erythromycin, so I stay away from it now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 149.66,
      "end_seconds": 153.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "Has anyone ever diagnosed you with something?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 155.07,
      "end_seconds": 158.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "Acid reflux, for about a year."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 158.82,
      "end_seconds": 160.81,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "I'll do your observations first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 171.57,
      "end_seconds": 174.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "Bear with me while this finishes..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 184.14,
      "end_seconds": 192.2,
      "duration_seconds": 8.06,
      "text": "Okay: temperature is 36.5 degrees, SpO2 98 percent on room air, heart rate 67, pressure 126 over 74."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 193.28,
      "end_seconds": 198.46,
      "duration_seconds": 5.18,
      "text": "I'll need to examine you for this, it won't take long."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 207.15,
      "end_seconds": 208.15,
      "duration_seconds": 1.0,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 210.11,
      "end_seconds": 211.39,
      "duration_seconds": 1.28,
      "text": "Look straight ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 223.77,
      "end_seconds": 228.75,
      "duration_seconds": 4.98,
      "text": "There is fine greasy scaling across the scalp with no bald patches."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.52,
      "end_seconds": 246.49,
      "duration_seconds": 11.97,
      "text": "Okay, that's enough for me. So, based on the history and the examination, my working impression is simple dandruff. We shouldn't forget seborrhoeic dermatitis."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 247.1,
      "end_seconds": 251.15,
      "duration_seconds": 4.05,
      "text": "I mean, is there something to worry about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 252.36,
      "end_seconds": 259.61,
      "duration_seconds": 7.25,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's simple dandruff, and we'll watch how it goes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 270.75,
      "end_seconds": 294.16,
      "duration_seconds": 23.41,
      "text": "We'll begin with ketoconazole shampoo, 2%, twice a week, four weeks. That's for dandruff. Leave the shampoo on for five minutes before rinsing. Don't skip meals, and try to eat smaller portions more often through the day. Is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 295.7,
      "end_seconds": 298.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "No, that's all. Thanks a lot."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 299.29,
      "end_seconds": 300.77,
      "duration_seconds": 1.48,
      "text": "Goodbye for now."
    }
  ]
}